  "decision_conditions": [
    "CAR FREE DEVELOPMENT: All future occupiers of the residential units hereby approved shall not be eligible to obtain an on street residents parking permit except: i) In the case of disabled persons; ii) In the case of units designated in this planning permission as 'non car free'; or iii) In the case of the resident who is an existing holder of a residents parking permit issued by the London Borough of Islington and has held the permit for a period of at least one year. \r\n\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development remains car free in accordance with policy T6 of the London Plan 2021, policy T3 of the Islington Local Plan: Strategic and Development Management Policies 2023 and Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA, sub–Paragraph MA.2(2)(a) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended)."
  ],
